<title>POLAND: Relpol 96 group net rises to PLN 5.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Relpol 96 group net rises to PLN 5.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Relpol preliminary consolidated results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     4.47   vs    7.38</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 8.16   vs    6.48</p>
<p>    net profit			     5.51   vs    4.42</p>
<p>    net sales			     39.15   vs   38.69</p>
<p>    costs of sales			28.62   vs   28.86</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.0    vs    0.0</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.78   vs    1.14</p>
<p>    other taxes			    1.03   vs    1.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  10.32   vs    2.35</p>
<p>    financial costs			6.68   vs    3.26</p>
<p>    investment			    53.12   vs   12.42</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is Relpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
